      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOEING THE LINE (5) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (19.74) at this track behind Max's Wish in a Maiden. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Expected to feature in the finish again. LITTLE LEXIE (8) turned in a fair run last time from the squeeze finishing fourth by 4.5 lengths (19.64). Has placed several times at this track. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Should be thereabouts. DETONATE DIGGER (1) is boxed nicely on the inside. Latest effort finished 3rd over 457m at Q Lakeside beaten 4.5 lengths (25.88) behind Gold Mythos in a Maiden on November 3. Can hit the frame with the right run. SWEET BAIRN (7) was out of the frame here on debut but can atone with the right run.",
